# Template: rule (rule_kind quality). Shared, because it constrains a shared
# interface whichever capability calls it. A quality rule applies through
# applies_to (flows, sequences, or interfaces).
ready: 2
kind: rule
id: rule.save-time
display_id: RULE-SAVE-TIME
rule_kind: quality
title: Saving answers quickly
summary: Saving a note answers within 300 milliseconds for nearly every request.
applies_to:
  - interface.save-note
measure: Time from the request to the reply, measured at the server
target: Under 300 milliseconds at the 95th percentile
